  m_text: 'To defeat a Boss, reduce its Health to 0 by dealing enough damage.

    If
    you defeat the Boss exactly(Boss HP: 5; Card played: 5), the Boss card is placed
    on top of the Deck.

    If you deal more damage than the Boss''s remaining HP,
    the Boss card is sent to the Graveyard instead.

'
